* cc2: load regulation sweep — latest topology (R_top/R_b, K1=2R, source-sense)
.inc models.inc
.param VS=3.3
V1 ta 0 {VS}
Rtop ta t 10k
Rb t 0 150k
Rsamp t sn R={RL}
Rk1 sn x 2
Vsm x dd 0
M1 dd g b b nmosb
Rs b 0 150k
R1 vset ta 360k
R2 vset 0 200k
Xop vset b ta 0 g opa391t3
.step param RL list 1k 5k 10k 20k 40k 60k 80k 100k 120k 130k
.op
.end
